  The reel_script and caption say the garbage was cleared 'in the panchayat' and 'in the Sindhalavadi panchayat'; the article only says the work was done in Sindhalavadi area, which is roughly consistent, but the slide claims the cleaning covered the whole village, which the article does not state.
